                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good dungeon delving RPG. \n\nSome of the fights can get quite tough and you need to plan ahead when it comes to food otherwise it can quickly turn into a chef simulator while your party is hiding in a corridor hoping nothing spawns. But this adds to feel of being cut off from the world in a hostile dungeon and living on what you find/magic up.\n\nI like the humour and the UI is quite easy to pick up, I also enjoy that the hand holding stops quite early on and the game just lets me figure out my own way to do things.",
